  "original_reproduction": "Updated native input regression against task-original ChallengeCreate:238 checks,28 failures. Every edge/return case detects the first-card-only motion.",
  "retained_corrections": [
    "The first wrapper draft used full-rect anchors before the strip had its layout size; initial child minimum width became an extra anchor offset, doubling the row width. Explicit top-left row sizing fixes the issue without weakening any whole-row, paging or full-width assertions. Initial238/13 and282/13 results are retained.",
    "The first integrated run hit a concurrent App/ChallengesPage landing_view mismatch before reaching the car picker. After that separate property update appeared, the unchanged integrated suite passed216 checks. No unrelated menu code was edited by this task.",
    "Script count changed from1014 to1015 while concurrent work continued."
  ],
